  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요. 임용 첫해 재과만에서 많은 도움을 받았습니다^ㅁ^</p><p>신규 교사분들께 도움이 되길 바라는 마음으로 수업 자료 올려봅니다 ㅎ.ㅎ</p><p>학습지는 김신연(경기) 선생님께서 올려주신 활동지 사용했습니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>* 다운이 안되거나 문제/수정 사항이 있으면 알려주세요 ㅠ.ㅠ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&lt;학습지 링크&gt;</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/1295\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/1295</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&lt;수업자료 링크&gt; - 용량이 커서 구글드라이브로 공유합니다!</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1I_z6fl2FjHzWh25w4bbo-hvPpPJNp-qP?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1I_z6fl2FjHzWh25w4bbo-hvPpPJNp-qP?usp=sharing</a></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b25717f0b8c22a23c23a93f3346420523c6be923\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b25717f0b8c22a23c23a93f3346420523c6be923\" data-origin-width=\"1665\" data-origin-height=\"796\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/01cba3b1ace80e66d83ca99c9b38f0992b99d2a1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/01cba3b1ace80e66d83ca99c9b38f0992b99d2a1\" data-origin-width=\"1665\" data-origin-height=\"789\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/de326bb3d1ae9df3132f68cee80165ed27c11679\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/de326bb3d1ae9df3132f68cee80165ed27c11679\" data-origin-width=\"1666\" data-origin-height=\"544\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvl6yvejnmgigc5lfzxmsfov8@my?service=daum